{"schema":"semaprax.bend2-law-benchmark.bounded-balance-edit-response.v1","trial_id":"bounded-balance-transfer-v1:semaprax-scalar-v1:1","language":"semaprax-scalar-v1","final_source":"module app;

@id("app.balance.debit-after")
fn debit_after() -> i64
    ensures result == 13
{
    20 - 7
}

@id("app.balance.credit-after")
fn credit_after() -> i64
    ensures result == 37
{
    30 + 7
}

@id("app.balance.total-after")
fn total_after() -> i64
    ensures result == 50
{
    13 + 37
}

@id("app.main")
fn main() -> i64
{
    debit_after()
}
","proof_explanation":"The debit subtracts the fixed transfer of 7 from 20, yielding 13. The credit adds 7 to 30, yielding 37. Their total is 13 + 37 = 50. Each value remains within 0..100.","seeded_attack":{"source_sha256":"sha256:c5103b9d54f484ca0a7cdd350e4804ab49d10a735dec915a9053483deaa82c2f","decision":"reject","reason":"The seeded debit_after body returns 20 without subtracting the transfer of 7, so it violates the required debit_after == 13 law."}}
